flowchart TB
    Client[User / CI / kubectl] --> Endpoint[Stable API endpoint]
    Endpoint --> API[kube-apiserver]
    API <--> ETCD[(etcd)]
    API --> Scheduler[kube-scheduler]
    API --> Controller[kube-controller-manager]
    API --> Cloud[cloud-controller-manager - optional]
    API <--> NodeA
    API <--> NodeB
    subgraph NodeA[Worker Node A]
      KubeletA[kubelet] --> RuntimeA[Container runtime]
      RuntimeA --> PodsA[Pods]
      NetA[CNI / Service dataplane]
    end
    subgraph NodeB[Worker Node B]
      KubeletB[kubelet] --> RuntimeB[Container runtime]
      RuntimeB --> PodsB[Pods]
      NetB[CNI / Service dataplane]
    end
    PodsA <--> PodsB
